{"productId": "5e79e200-5fa2-46e7-a556-4b4581c006af", "modelName": "CR920 Elite", "modelDescription": "The CR920 is manufactured wholly in the United States using American labor and materials. The veteran-led team at Shadow Systems includes former law enforcement officers, members of the military, and competitive shooters. This diverse background contributes to Shadow Systems' unique design philosophy of building pistols with features based on real-world shooting experience. Every Shadow Systems pistol is designed to be highly reliable and easy to shoot well right out of the box. Internals feature a stainless-steel guide rod and a drop-safe, flat-faced trigger. The trigger has a 4.5-5.0 pound trigger pull and a crisp, tactile reset. The CR920 ships in a zippered pistol rug with two magazines: a 13+1 capacity magazine and a flush 10+1 capacity magazine. The optic cut on the CR920 allows for direct-to-slide mounting of most brands of mini-RDS optics, including the Shield RMS and Holosun 507k. The CR920 has a match-grade, spiral-fluted 3.41-inch barrel.", "manufacturerName": "Shadow Systems", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "5fbcb41e-596b-43e7-87a1-cbfd5e0d94fb", "description": "Shadow Systems, CR920P Elite, Semi Automatic, 9mm, 3.75 Barrel, Black Nitride Finish, Compensated, Right Hand, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/f4731830-8d36-4bdd-9a6f-5b198267e26d", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d3e57e71-c3e2-4f6c-a889-47a1cbf89104", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/feb913f8-605c-4dce-8107-86e382650680"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "SS4239", "upc": "810120311746", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5484bfc3-10d4-4ad1-ba8b-bd2973f49143", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "72f9effd-b731-4455-a587-2eed3d4aa887", "valueName": "Black"}, {"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5-93de-487557